                                                "sense_id": "1ce62974-faa0-34bf-ac9d-dbf73b7496b2",
                                                "text": "Farther to the southward, the rivers which are affluent to the Colorado, such as the Rio Virgen, and Gila river, near their mouths, are impregnated with salt by the cliffs of rock salt between which they pass."
                                            }
